forbidden:
- concrete Business Domain Capability Operation Interface payload state data outcome or permission semantics as input or owned output
- Q.UI Module Surface Render or Host execution
- Q.Theme visual semantic ownership
- Domain Contract as live semantic authority
- public boundary inference from repository code or AI
- Q.APP-owned P2.Consumer mount or direct runtime dependency to a concrete Business Domain
- repository src/p1/export projection as a concrete Q.APP P1 Capability physical path
- obsolete non-normative persistence-authority assumption as CURRENT authority
- copy Contract authority bytes into implementation repository
- direct handler import used as dependency authority
- moving CURRENT alias in resolved runtime or generation snapshot
- Q.Gate PASS implementation activation or runtime ACTIVE claim from this Contract alone
